<title>USA: Steelworker/WHX meeting to include LaBow.</title>
<headline>Steelworker/WHX meeting to include LaBow.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for the United Steelworkers union said a meeting scheduled for Thursday between the union and WHX Corp will include company Chairman Ron LaBow.</p>
<p>He said the meeting will be held in New York and also will include Jim Bowen, the union's chief negotiator. LaBow has not participated in negotiations since 4,500 steelworkers went on strike against the company on October 1 over a pension dispute.</p>
<p>The meeting does not include either side's negotiating committee.</p>
</text>
